  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nigeria - Infrastructure Credit Guarantee Company Limited (Infracredit)</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Nigeria - Infrastructure Credit Guarantee Company Limited (Infracredit)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">L&#x2019;investissement de la Banque vise &#xe0; renforcer la capacit&#xe9; d&apos;InfraCredit &#xe0; soutenir l&#x2019;apport de garanties de cr&#xe9;dit pour les obligations d&apos;entreprises &#xe9;mises pour financer les infrastructures, afin de faciliter le financement des actifs d&apos;infrastructure, en mettant l&apos;accent sur le financement de projets verts &#xe9;ligibles au Nigeria dans le cadre du Green Finance Framework d&apos;InfraCredit et de la Clean Energy Transition Strategy &amp; Roadmap 2022-2040.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Bank&#x2019;s investment aims to enhance InfraCredit&#x2019;s capacity to support the provision of credit guarantees for corporate bonds issued to finance infrastructure, to facilitate the financing of infrastructure assets, with a focus on the financing of eligible green projects in Nigeria under InfraCredit&#x2019;s Green Finance Framework and Clean Energy Transition Strategy &amp; Roadmap 2022-2040.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="3">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">Le b&#xe9;n&#xe9;ficiaire direct de l&#x2019;intervention est l&#x2019; &#xab;Infrastructure Credit Guarantee Company Limited &#xbb;. Par ailleurs, elle soutiendra l&#x2019;apport de garanties de cr&#xe9;dit pour les obligations d&apos;entreprises &#xe9;mises pour financer les infrastructures.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The direct beneficiary of the intervention is the &#xab;Infrastructure Credit Guarantee Company Limited&#xbb;. In addition, it will support the provision of credit guarantees for corporate bonds issued to finance infrastructure.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="FR">La pr&#xe9;sente intervention est relative &#xe0; l&#x2019;octroi d&#x2019;un pr&#xea;t subordonn&#xe9; de 15 millions d&#x2019;USD &#xe0; Infrastructure Credit Guarantee Company Limited. Le projet d&#x2019;investissement de la Banque vise &#xe0; soutenir le financement des infrastructures en monnaie locale et l&#x2019;approfondissement des march&#xe9;s de capitaux d&#x2019;emprunt des entreprises locales au Nigeria. Il incitera les fonds de pension et d&#x2019;autres investisseurs institutionnels &#xe0; se lancer dans le financement de projets d&#x2019;infrastructure &#xe0; long terme. Le pr&#xea;t subordonn&#xe9; permettra de renforcer l&#x2019;assise financi&#xe8;re d&#x2019;InfraCredit et d&#x2019;am&#xe9;liorer sa capacit&#xe9; &#xe0; garantir un plus grand nombre d&#x2019;obligations d&#x2019;infrastructure, en particulier dans le cadre de projets verts et ax&#xe9;s sur la lutte contre les changements climatiques.  Le projet contribue au financement climatique, avec une enveloppe de 11 millions USD du montant total approuv&#xe9; d&#xe9;di&#xe9;e &#xe0; l&#x2019;adaptation.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This intervention is related to provision of a subordinated loan of USD 15 million to Infrastructure Credit Guarantee Company Limited. The proposed Bank investment aims to support infrastructure financing in local currency and local corporate debt capital markets deepening in Nigeria. It will catalyse pension funds and other institutional investors&#x2019; resources into financing long-term infrastructure projects. This will be achieved by strengthening InfraCredit&#x2019;s capital base through the subordinated loan, improving its capacity to guarantee more infrastructure bonds especially for green and climate aligned projects. The project contributes to climate finance, with 11 million USD of the total approved amount dedicated to adaptation.</narrative>
  </description>
